description>Users can create photorealistic images with an even more powerful Image Playground, and have brand-new ways to modify their images by describing what they want or with touch.</video:description><video:content_loc>https://www.apple.com/newsroom/videos/2026/hls/06/apple-intelligence-image-playground/US/US/Apple-Intelligence-Image-Playground-260608_16x9.m3u8</video:content_loc><video:duration>39</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-06-09T21:22:41Z</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video><video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://www.apple.com/newsroom/videos/2026/autoplay/06/apple-intelligence-shortcuts-describe-a-shortcut/posters/Apple-Intelligence-Shortcuts-describe-a-shortcut-260608.jpg.large_2x.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>Describe a Shortcut</video:title><video:description>Shortcuts uses Apple Intelligence to reason over a user’s natural language description and assembles all of the required steps to create a shortcut.</video:description><video:content_loc>https://www.apple.com/newsroom/videos/2026/autoplay/06/apple-intelligence-shortcuts-describe-a-shortcut/large_2x.mp4</video:content_loc><video:duration>10</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-06-09T21:22:41Z</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video><video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://www.apple.com/newsroom/videos/2026/autoplay/06/apple-intelligence-summarized-activity-notifications/posters/Apple-Intelligence-summarized-activity-notifications-260608.jpg.large_2x.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>A Smarter Home App</video:title><video:description>With Apple Intelligence, the Home app can now understand related accessory notifications as a single activity.</video:description><video:content_loc>https://www.apple.com/newsroom/videos/2026/autoplay/06/apple-intelligence-summarized-activity-notifications/large_2x.mp4</video:content_loc><video:duration>16</video:duration><video:publ